  "title": "Classic Beef Stroganoff in a Slow Cooker",
  "description": "Beef stroganoff is easy in the slow cooker. Made with top round steak, sliced fresh mushrooms, and egg noodles, it's a delicious family meal.",
  "authors": [
    "pianoplaya93"
  ],
